        "navigation_id": "PSA.34:P:psa-34-1-22-on-the-title-compare-1sa-21-13-abimelech-was-the-general-name-of-t",
        "scope": "passage",
        "role": "passage_overview",
        "title": "Psa 34:1-22 . On the title compare 1Sa 21:13 . Abimelech was the general name of the sovereign ( Ge 20:2 ). After celebrating God's gracious dealings with him, the Psalmist exhorts others to make trial of His providential care, instructing them how to secure it. He then contrasts God's care of His people and His punitive providence towards the wicked."
      }
